<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WE-SMSA_3.3MM" prefix="MP" library_version="2">
<description>&lt;B&gt;&lt;b&gt; WE-SMSA SMT Spacer Studs Automotive &lt;/B&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt; Characteristics
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;Material: Steel
&lt;br&gt; Surface: Tin
&lt;br&gt; For distances from 1 to 15 mm
&lt;br&gt; Full automation for fast and precise process
&lt;br&gt; High holding forces and torques
&lt;br&gt; Highest process reliability
&lt;br&gt; Instant removable polyimid tape

&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Applications 
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/b&gt;Assembling of PCBs to housing and to other PCBs

&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.we-online.de/catalog/media/o188682v209%2078614xxx960_group_.jpg"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://www.we-online.de/catalog/media/o188682v209%2078614xxx960_group_.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Details see: &lt;a href="https://www.we-online.de/katalog/en/WE_SMSA"&gt;https://www.we-online.de/katalog/en/WE_SMSA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;

Created by Ella Wu 2020-12-15&lt;br&gt;
2020 (C) Wurth Elektronik</description>
